      "claim": "Although birth defects could occur with exposure to methotrexate any time in the first trimester, limited evidence suggests that methotrexate-related birth defects are more likely to occur if a pregnancy is exposed to 10 mg or more of methotrexate per week between 6 and 8 weeks after conception (8 to 10 weeks after the first day of the last menstrual period).",
